### 2. THE DECISIVE QUESTION: does it run the COMPRESSIBLE solver? ###
  CompressibleSIMPLE mentions in the low-Mach test : 0
  incompressible SIMPLE solve calls               : 1
  what it builds the compressible quantities FROM:
    161:  const VectorField& velocity = flow.velocity;
    177:    density[i] = thermo.density(pressureAbsolute[i], kTemperature);
    193:    machMax = std::max(machMax, machNumber(speed, soundSpeed));
  => the density, Mach number and compressible mass flux are all evaluated ON THE
     INCOMPRESSIBLE SOLUTION. There is no compressible solve, so 'the compressible
     solution approaches the incompressible one' is TRUE BY CONSTRUCTION and measures
     nothing. Authorization section 20 names this exact degenerate case.

